  description: "Each time a face-up Plant-Type monster(s) on the field is destroyed,
    place 1 Flower Counter on this card. You can remove any number of Flower Counters
    from this card to activate these effects.\n\u25CF 1 Counter: Target 1 Plant-Type
    monster on the field; that target gains 400 ATK and DEF until the end of this
    turn. (This ATK gain remains even if this card leaves the field.)\n\u25CF 2 Counters:
    Target 1 card on the field; destroy that target.\n\u25CF 3 Counters: Target 1
    Plant-Type monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon that target."
